flowchart TD
    A([Start: target folder]) --> B{Folder exists<br/>and readable?}
    B -- No --> E1[Log error and exit]
    B -- Yes --> C{Any files?}
    C -- No --> E2[Log: nothing to organize]
    C -- Yes --> D[For each file:<br/>read extension]
    D --> F[Pick subfolder<br/>e.g. txt, jpg, no_extension]
    F --> G{Name already<br/>exists there?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Rename: file_1.ext, file_2.ext...]
    G -- No --> I[Keep name]
    H --> J{Dry run?}
    I --> J
    J -- Yes --> K[Log preview only]
    J -- No --> L[Move file safely]
    L --> M[Log filename, source, destination]
    K --> N
    M --> N{More files?}
    N -- Yes --> D
    N -- No --> O([Print summary:<br/>moved, skipped, errors])
